' Independently authored Kobrixa example
' A nearby ball is loaded in the scene; D drives the launcher.
Folder "prjs" "Kobrixa"

' 場景已在發射口附近放球，D 埠負責發射機構。
' The configured positive 180-degree shaft stroke triggers one shot.
' 正向累積 180 度馬達行程會觸發一次發射，反轉回位不會觸發。
LCD.Clear()
LCD.Text(1, 0, 0, 0, "Ready to shoot")
Program.Delay(500)
Motor.Move("D", 70, 180, True)
LCD.Text(1, 0, 20, 0, "Shot released")

' Retract after the first stroke. / 第一行程完成後反轉回位。
Motor.Move("D", -35, 180, True)
Motor.Stop("D", True)
Program.Delay(2000)
LCD.Text(1, 0, 40, 0, "Shooter complete")
